WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.815 --> 00:00:02.020
What do you think?

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.315
It's great

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.220
Do you think it's an issue that I'm on parole?

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.240
Sorry?

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.520
I just made a stupid joke about

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.420
being on parole

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.260
So you're a writer?

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.260
Yes

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.780
I'm assuming this is a work in progress?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.740
I'm trying

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.660
Are you... breaking up with me?

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:23.480
(Phone rings)

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.540
Hey what's up?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.620
Ben lives here

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.520
What?

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.440
Hey

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.840
So we're neighbors?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.380
Hi...hi

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.760
That's weird. That's kind of like a crazy ex-girlfriend thing to do

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.640
Excuse me?

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.680
I mean I didn't know that he lived there

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.020
Oooowww

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.500
Oh my god, are you okay?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.500
I'm fine

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.620
We're gonna get into a cab

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.400
Where'd the blood come from?

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.300
So how are you?

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.780
Its going pretty well

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.500
I'm...I'm on the road

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.980
Wait you're touring?

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:58.740
I'm sorry I meant the figurative road, I see how that would be misleading

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.020
Are you guys dating?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:01.940
Yeah

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.620
Cool. Great.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.040
Do you think you could back off Ben a little bit?

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.100
But I... live here

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.100
Yeah, I can see you when you're creeping outside his window

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.880
Definitely not creeping

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:17.000
Why is it a crime to want to be friends with your ex-boyfriend?

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.400
What's going on with Ben?

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.060
Um.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:20.820
Nothing

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.580
He's probably still in love with you

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.540
He's almost certainly still in love with you

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:33.100
You ready? Yes, born ready

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.900
 

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.940
I don't know what I'm doing

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.660
Want to go get drunk? Yes

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:48.420
I thought that if I ended it, that it would be less painful later on

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.220
But it wasn't

00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:53.255
I think about you all the time

00:01:55.835 --> 00:01:57.805
 

